            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Using Holter monitoring in patients with freshly developed and advancing stenocardia allows to establish the character and features of painful and asymptomatic ischemia which creates the possibilities for differentiated treatment of these groups of patients as well as to evaluate the efficacy of therapy.</AbstractText>
